格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"轻松换行","id":"gh:1345774710","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-ctrl-enter-submit","slug":"SA1992X/dsh-ctrl-enter-submit","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# dsh-ctrl-enter-submit"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 插件：将文本输入的提交快捷键从 **Enter** 改为 **Ctrl/Cmd+Enter**。覆盖主对话框与 Agent 提问卡片（`ask_user_"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"question`）的所有输入控件；可在「设置 → 插件」中随时开关，禁用后恢复默认行为。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## 行为"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| 按键 | 插件启用时 | 插件禁用后 |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Enter | 多行框换行；单行框/选项按钮不动作 | 提交消息 / 回答 / 下一题 |\n| Ctrl/Cmd+Enter | 提交消息 / 回答 / 下一题 | 提交（DSH 原本就支持） |"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"\n| Shift+Enter | 多行框换行 | 提交消息（DSH 原生行为） |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"适用范围：主对话框 composer，以及 Agent 提问卡片（`ask_user_question`）的所有输入控件——多行 textarea（普通 Enter / Shift+Enter 换行）"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"、单行自定义输入框（普通 Enter 不动作）、选项按钮（普通 Enter 不再选中/跳题，鼠标点击与空格选择不受影响）。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"`/` 和 `@` 触发菜单打开时，Enter 仍然正常选择菜单项，不会被拦截。输入法组合状态下也不会被拦截。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"从插件市场安装：打开 **Settings → Plugin Market**，搜索 `dsh-ctrl-enter-submit`，一键安装。"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"或用命令行："},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"安装后刷新浏览器页面即可生效（纯客户端插件，无需重启服务）。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 启用 / 禁用"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"在 DSH Web 界面的 **设置 → 插件（Plugins）** 中找到 `ctrl-enter-submit`，用开关切换：\n- 关闭：立即恢复 Enter 提交（刷新页面后生效）\n- 打开：恢"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"→ 插件（Plugins）** 中找到 `ctrl-enter-submit`，用开关切换：\n- 关闭：立即恢复 Enter 提交（刷新页面后生效）\n- 打开：恢复 Ctrl/Cmd+Enter 提交"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"卸载："},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 工作原理"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"插件在浏览器端的 `document` 捕获阶段拦截 `keydown` 事件，因此一定早于编辑器根元素上的键盘监听与 React 在容器上的委托监听："},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- 主对话框输入面按版本分两种：\n- DSH ≥ 0.1.2：composer 是 Lexical `contenteditable`（`[data-composer-input]`），普通 Ente"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"r 会被伪装成 Shift+Enter，由 DSH 自己的 `INSERT_LINE_BREAK` 命令插入换行，与用户按住 Shift 按 Enter 完全一致；伪装失败时退化为阻断提交链路\n- 更"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"早版本：composer 是 `textarea`，普通 Enter 与 Shift+Enter 调用 `stopImmediatePropagation()` 阻止 React 的 `onKeyDo"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"wn`（即 DSH 的提交逻辑），但不调用 `preventDefault()`，因此照常换行\n- Ctrl/Cmd+Enter：一律放行，由 DSH 正常提交\n- `/`、`@` 触发菜单打开时不接"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"管，Enter 仍然选择候选项；输入法组合状态（中文/日文/韩文输入等）也不接管\n- 无会话的工作区引导态（composer 不可编辑）不接管\n- 插件 Host 端为空操作，所有功能均在浏览器 Cl"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"仍然选择候选项；输入法组合状态（中文/日文/韩文输入等）也不接管\n- 无会话的工作区引导态（composer 不可编辑）不接管\n- 插件 Host 端为空操作，所有功能均在浏览器 Client 端实现"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## 兼容性"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- 需要 dsh web `0.1.0-rc.6` 或更高版本；已在 `0.1.2-rc.1` 的 contenteditable composer 上验证\n- 在 Windows、macOS、Lin"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ux 上均可工作（Ctrl 和 Cmd 都识别）"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 本地开发"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"用本地路径以链接方式安装，改完 `client.js` 后刷新浏览器即可看到效果，无需重新发布："},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"DSH Desktop 用的是 `desktop` profile，把 `--profile web` 换成 `--profile desktop` 即可。"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"# English"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin that changes the submit shortcut from **Enter** to **Ctrl/Cmd+Enter*"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"*. It covers the main composer and every input control in the agent question card (`ask_user_questio"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"n`). Toggle it on/off anytime in **Settings → Plugins**; disabling restores the default Enter-submit"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"e it on/off anytime in **Settings → Plugins**; disabling restores the default Enter-submit behavior."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Behavior"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Key | Plugin enabled | Plugin disabled |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Enter | Newline in multiline fields; no action in single-line inputs / option buttons | Submits th"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e message / answer / advances |\n| Ctrl/Cmd+Enter | Submits the message / answer / advances | Submits"},{"id":"p31s3","text":" (DSH supports this natively) |\n| Shift+Enter | Newline in multiline fields | Submits the message (D"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"SH native behavior) |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Scope: the main composer and the agent question card (`ask_user_question`) — multiline textarea (pla"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"in Enter / Shift+Enter insert a newline), single-line custom-answer input (plain Enter does nothing)"},{"id":"p32s3","text":", and option buttons (plain Enter no longer selects/advances; mouse click and Space still select)."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"When the `/` or `@` candidate menu is open, Enter selects the highlighted item as usual. IME composi"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"tion is never intercepted."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"From the Plugin Market: open **Settings → Plugin Market**, search for `dsh-ctrl-enter-submit`, and i"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"nstall with one click."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Or from the command line:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Refresh the browser page after installing (client-only plugin, no restart needed)."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Enable / Disable"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Find `ctrl-enter-submit` in **Settings → Plugins** and toggle it:\n- Off: Enter submits again (takes "},{"id":"p40s2","text":"effect after a page refresh)\n- On: Ctrl/Cmd+Enter submits"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"To uninstall:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"The plugin intercepts `keydown` on `document` during the capture phase, so it always runs before the"},{"id":"p44s2","text":" editor root's keyboard listeners and React's delegated listeners:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- The composer input surface depends on the DSH version:\n- DSH ≥ 0.1.2: the composer is a Lexical `c"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"ontenteditable` host (`[data-composer-input]`); plain Enter is turned into a Shift+Enter gesture han"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"dled by DSH's own `INSERT_LINE_BREAK` command, exactly like holding Shift while pressing Enter. If t"},{"id":"p45s4","text":"he gesture cannot be applied, the plugin falls back to blocking the submit chain.\n- Older versions: "},{"id":"p45s5","text":"the composer is a `textarea`; plain Enter and Shift+Enter call `stopImmediatePropagation()` so React"},{"id":"p45s6","text":"'s `onKeyDown` (DSH's submit logic) never sees them, without calling `preventDefault()`, so the text"},{"id":"p45s7","text":"area still inserts a newline.\n- Ctrl/Cmd+Enter is always left untouched and submits as usual.\n- Whil"},{"id":"p45s8","text":"e the `/` or `@` trigger menu is open the key is not intercepted, and IME composition is never inter"},{"id":"p45s9","text":"cepted.\n- The non-session workspace-trigger state (composer not editable) is left untouched.\n- The h"},{"id":"p45s10","text":"ost entry is a no-op; all behavior lives in the browser client."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"- Requires dsh web `0.1.0-rc.6` or later; verified against the contenteditable composer of `0.1.2-rc"},{"id":"p47s2","text":".1`.\n- Works on Windows, macOS, and Linux (both Ctrl and Cmd are recognized)."},{"id":"p48s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
